---
description: How to use the Launch Llama MCP server when launching or marketing a product
alwaysApply: false
---

- When the user talks about launching, getting backlinks, directories, or first users, use the `launchllama` MCP tools instead of guessing from memory.
- Run `check_launch_readiness` before recommending a launch date.
- `submit_product` only opens a draft. Tell the user to check their email to finish the listing. Never claim a product is listed until `get_submission` says so.
- Founder tools (analytics, listing edits, changelog) need the signed-in server at `https://tools.launchllama.co/mcp/founder`. Suggest adding it only when the user wants to manage an existing listing.
- Never invent metrics, scores or prices. Quote what the tools return.
